# Generated visual-interaction QA evidence is local-only. Screenshots, raw
# browser logs, harness output, and disposable review scripts can contain
# machine-specific or child-entered data. Only a separately authored, compact,
# sanitized conclusion may be added to a public location outside this tree.
/qa/reviews/visual-interaction/

